// Name :
"P200501809" "Drea the Hook"
// ProfessionString :
"P977252637" "Broker"
// DescriptionString :
"P4236397995" "Boris was a high-ranking KGB officer in the old Soviet Empire. Rumor is that after the Cold War he joined up with Arachnos. If that's true, he must have displeased Lord Recluse because he now works the streets of Cap au Diable."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P2369373866" "My tasks are not for the likes of you, {HeroName}. Find someone else to pester."
// HelloString :
"P3941598294" "Beat it. I have nothing for you now. I vill call you ven I hear something, da?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3055645767" "Vat are you doing here? I do not know you. Perhaps you are looking for Desdemona the Glint. I am Boris, from Siberia."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3794693784" "I am Boris. From Sibera. People call me 'the Russian' but I am Siberian, not Russian. Stupid people. You do not seem strong, but I vill give you chance. When I hear of heists I vill put message in paper. You come to Boris and ve vill discuss split. Da?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1419818965" "Notasksremainingstring"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3236333792" "There is a Siberian proverb that says a man should not drink two bottles of vodka at once. Come back when you are not so busy and ve vill discuss business."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3761522872" "Bah. You are tiny and unimpressive. Come back when you're Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3024462276" "You are doing vell, {VillainName}. Boris is pleased."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2462484591" "Hmph. You are attracting too much attention vith your Vestern cowboy vays. But you are good earner."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1472875839" "I know nothing. Come back later and ve vill share some vodka and discuss other opportunities."
// LocationString :
"P3766049399" "Cap au Diable"
// IntroString :
"P2990147045" "Boris isn't exactly a friendly sort, but his tips are first-rate. Former KGB, I think. His accent is thick, but I don't recommend you make fun of it. He's a little sensitive."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2937819059" "Choose Boris the Russian"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P4216898869" "Remember what I said. Boris has good info, but I wouldn't trust him further than I could throw him."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2548054189" "I've got <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</a> I'd like you to meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2589570214" "There are a couple <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</a> I know want to meet you."
