// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Drea the Hook 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P4068575212" "Drea the Hook made his living as a crab fisherman, until his boat, and everyone else on it, went down in the icy waters off the coast of Alaska. Since that day, Drea can't seem to shake his fear of the sea. He doesn't have much compunction about the deals he brokers for villains in Port Oakes, though he knows that innocents often pay the price. Drea's just looking to put away a chunk of change that'll buy him a cozy retirement in a nice, landlocked community. His dedication to that dream makes him a reliable source of information."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P801789530" "I ain't got anything for you right now, but check back after you pull off a couple more of your own capers."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3307032112" "I don't know you from Adam, bub. Maybe you want Mikey the Ear."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3521425826" "My name's Drea. That's all you need to know. The less we know about each other, the better for both of us, dig? You do your own thing out there, and if I get a tip on something big going down--like a bank heist or something--I'll put a coded message in the Rogue Isle Protector. Just make sure to check out the newspaper from time to time."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1011468696" "I see you're too busy for me right now. Lemme know when you've freed up some of your own schemes."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2368658531" "I know some things, but they're big. Too big for anyone below Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P563578005" "Well, well, {VillainName}. I think this may be the beginning of a beautiful friendship."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2366229121" "You've made quite a rep out there, {VillainName}."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2470131391" "I got nothing more that would interest you, {VillainName}."
// LocationString :
"P3345659944" "Port Oakes"
// IntroString :
"P3720490652" "I'd like you to meet someone named Drea the Hook. He can get you intel on everybody in Port Oakes."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1906228434" "Choose Drea the Hook"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1042601697" "Drea's tied into a lot of seedy types. You figure out what you want to do, he can likely tell you where to go and who's in your way."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1173284174" "Couple <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</a> I know want to meet you."
