// Name :
"P415171471" "Mikey the Ear"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P3731797860" "Mikey has put his big ears to use. It's said he hears everything going on in Port Oakes. Some think he might even have mutant powers."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P239951722" "Hey, {VillainName}! I hear you've been on a crime spree. Nice work. Keep it up and I'll have something really big for you."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3502666094" "You sure you're looking for me? Maybe you want Drea the Hook instead."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1327694526" "It's an honor to meet you, {VillainName}. I'm Mikey the Ear. Snitch extraordinaire. When you've made a name for yourself, I'll let you in on some big jobs. Bank heists and stuff like that. I'll let you know when by putting a secret code in the Rogue Isle Protector. Look for it while you're planning your schemes and we'll make some serious moola together. Capiche?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3801842601" "I hear you got enough goin' on right now, {VillainName}. Keep checkin' back though. I'll have something big for you eventually."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1260527201" "I deal mostly with the big boys around here. Come back when you're Threat Level {Level} and I'll be happy to tell you everything I hear."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2124504879" "I hear bad things about you. And in the Rogue Isles, bad is good."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1251757041" "You're doing some real damage out there, <VillainName>. I'm happy to be a part of your wrecking crew."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2442409929" "Sorry, friend. I ain't heard nothin' you'd be interested in."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3260495686" "They say Mikey the Ear hears everything that takes place in Port Oakes."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1565814320" "Choose Mikey the Ear"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1633193927" "Mikey's got his ear to the ground in Port Oakes."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P706259802" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>I hear a friend of mine </a> is looking to meet you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3428775255" "I hear some of my other  <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friends</a> would like to meet you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


