"P879093540" "<color deepskyblue>Now that you've been introduced to your Broker, you can start scanning the Rogue Isles Protector, the local newspaper, for jobs you want to pull. There you'll find tips for your next grand scheme or nefarious plot.<br><br>Just click on the Newspaper in your Contact window to scan the latest headlines for jobs you want to pull. If you stay active and make a name for yourself in a zone, the Broker there will eventually introduce you to nefarious new Contacts and tip you off to Heists and other special missions.</color>"
